# Generation originals: full-res PNG candidates and crops, ~9GB across four
# packs and growing every art session (owner's call, 2026-08-19). PNGs do not
# delta-compress, so committing them would bloat every clone forever to keep
# re-crop candidates almost nobody needs. The live art IS committed - one
# webp per card under public/card-art/ - and the pack files carry the brief
# that produced each one, so any image can be regenerated. Keep this tree on
# the machine that generates; back it up outside git.
/card-art-source/
